# Feralas, Alliance 43 to 45: Feathermoon Stronghold and the mainland.
# Consensus route visit 46 (the simulator's Alliance route, shared by every
# Alliance race from level 12): Badlands and the Hinterlands -> Theramore ->
# here -> Tanaris -> the Hinterlands.
#
# Flow: the Feathermoon island quests (Solarsal ruins, Hatecrest naga), a
# southern mainland loop (the courier's boat, the Gordunni camp, the Feral
# Scar yetis), Lord Shalzaru on the Isle of Dread, then one long eastern loop
# (Grimtotem camp, Woodpaw gnolls and the Writhing Deep, Thalanaar, the Rage
# Scar yetis, Rockbiter and Shay), a short grind and a last stop at the
# Forgotten Coast dock for Zorbin's giants.
#
# Deviations from the export (local order only): The Mark of Quality (2821)
# and In Search of Knowledge (2939) are taken on the first Feathermoon visit,
# and the yeti hides come from the Feral Scar yetis on the first mainland loop
# instead of a later return. Lonebrow's Journal (1100) is handed in at
# Thalanaar when the eastern loop passes it, not on the way out to Tanaris.
# The eastern loop runs Grimtotem -> Writhing Deep -> Thalanaar -> Rage Scar
# -> Rockbiter and ends with the hearth, instead of crossing the zone twice.
# Feathermoon on arrival runs flight master, Pratt, inn, Latronicus and
# Shandris, Ginro, Troyas, Angelas, without walking back past Pratt.
#
# Dropped: Find and Rescue OOX-22/FE! (2766, 2767). The beacon is a 1-2.5%
# drop and the reward waits in Booty Bay, which the route no longer visits at
# this level (a flight there and a long one back for its turn-ins).
#
# Optional: the Pristine Yeti Hide (7735) is a 3% drop: taken if it drops,
# never farmed. Zul'Farrak is offered as an optional alternative to the 49
# minute yeti grind before Zorbin's level 45 quests.
#
# Left out: Rise of the Silithid (4267: never handed in by the route; Gadgetzan's
# 162 takes you to the same Darnassus NPC), Rhapsody's Kalimdor Kocktail (1452:
# the route never hands it in) and Screecher Spirits (3520, Tanaris: same).
# No class training here: the route trains next in Ironforge at 46.
guide forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas
title Feralas
faction Alliance
levels 43-46
zone Feralas
next forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Feathermoon

step Feathermoon Stronghold
  tip From Theramore, fly to Nijel's Point and ride south out of Desolace into Feralas; the road leads west to the Forgotten Coast dock, where the boat crosses to Feathermoon on Sardor Isle.
  getfp "Feathermoon" npc 8019        -- Fyldren Moonfeather
  accept 2821                         -- Pratt McGrubben
  sethome "Feathermoon Stronghold" npc 7736 -- Innkeeper Shyria
  accept 4124                         -- Latronicus Moonspear, at the top of the stronghold
  accept 2866                         -- Shandris Feathermoon, beside him
  turnin 4124                         -- Ginro Hearthkindle
  accept 4125
  accept 2939                         -- Troyas Moonbreeze: his answer waits in Rut'theran Village, later
  accept 2982                         -- Angelas Moonbreeze

step Ruins of Solarsal
  tip Walk south along the island to the naga ruins; the gazebo stands among them.
  turnin 2866                         -- Solarsal Gazebo
  accept 2867

step Feathermoon Stronghold
  turnin 2867                         -- Shandris Feathermoon
  accept 3130
  turnin 3130                         -- Latronicus Moonspear
  accept 2869

step Hatecrest naga
  tip Back to the Ruins of Solarsal. Every Hatecrest naga there can drop scales.
  collect 9247 quest 2869             -- Hatecrest Naga Scale

step Feathermoon Stronghold
  turnin 2869                         -- Latronicus Moonspear
  accept 2870
  note Lord Shalzaru waits for the end of the mainland loop.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The southern mainland

step The courier's boat
  tip Take the boat to the Forgotten Coast and follow the shore south to the wrecked row boat on the beach.
  turnin 4125                         -- Wrecked Row Boat
  accept 4127

step Gordunni ogres
  tip Ride east to the Gordunni camp in the hills south-east of the yeti valley: Warlocks and Shaman hold the camp, Brutes wander the slopes around it and further north.
  kill 5240 quest 2982                -- Gordunni Warlock
  kill 5236 quest 2982                -- Gordunni Shaman
  kill 5232 quest 2982                -- Gordunni Brute

step Feral Scar Vale
  tip Ride north into the yeti valley. Every Feral Scar yeti can drop a thick hide; Bloodroar the Stalker (level 48) prowls the middle.
  collect 8973 quest 2821             -- Thick Yeti Hide

step Feathermoon Stronghold
  tip Ride back north-west to the Forgotten Coast dock and take the boat to the island.
  turnin 4127                         -- Ginro Hearthkindle
  accept 4129
  turnin 4129                         -- Quintis Jonespyre
  accept 4130
  turnin 4130                         -- Ginro Hearthkindle
  accept 4131
  turnin 2982                         -- Angelas Moonbreeze
  turnin 2821                         -- Pratt McGrubben
  accept 7733

step Lord Shalzaru
  tip Swim south from the island to the Isle of Dread. Hatecrest Serpent Guards and Sorceresses hold it; Lord Shalzaru (level 47) waits in the cave at its south end. Pull his guards first.
  collect 9248 quest 2870             -- Mysterious Relic

step Feathermoon Stronghold
  tip Hearth to Feathermoon.
  hearth "Feathermoon Stronghold"
  turnin 2870                         -- Latronicus Moonspear
  accept 2871
  turnin 2871                         -- Vestia Moonspear

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The eastern loop

step Grimtotem camp
  tip Boat to the Forgotten Coast and ride east across Feralas to the Grimtotem camp north of the road. Kindal Moonweaver waits outside it; free the Sprite Darters from the pen in the middle and keep Kindal and at least six of them alive.
  accept 2969                         -- Kindal Moonweaver
  complete 2969
  turnin 2969
  accept 2970                         -- Jer'kai Moonweaver

step Grimtotem tauren
  kill 7726 quest 2970                -- Grimtotem Naturalist
  kill 7725 quest 2970                -- Grimtotem Raider
  kill 7727 quest 2970                -- Grimtotem Shaman

step Jer'kai Moonweaver
  turnin 2970
  accept 2972                         -- for Tyrande in Darnassus: the route takes you there at 47

step The Writhing Deep
  tip Ride south-east to the Woodpaw gnolls; the courier's backpacks lie in their southern camp, and a parcel inside them starts a delivery to Thalanaar. The Zukk'ash hive is just south: fight down to the pod that holds Raschal, free him and keep him alive on the way out.
  turnin 4131                         -- Large Leather Backpacks
  accept 4135
  collect 11463                       -- Undelivered Parcel, from the backpacks
  accept 4281
  turnin 4135                         -- Zukk'ash Pod
  accept 4265
  complete 4265

step Thalanaar
  tip Ride north-east to the night elf outpost on the Thousand Needles border.
  getfp "Thalanaar" npc 4319          -- Thyssiana
  turnin 4281                         -- Falfindel Waywarder
  turnin 1100                         -- if you carry Lonebrow's Journal from Thousand Needles

step Rage Scar yetis
  tip Ride back west along the road, then north into the Rage Scar hills. Every yeti here can drop a hide; one may drop a Pristine Yeti Hide, which Pratt pays for too.
  collect 18947 quest 7733            -- Rage Scar Yeti Hide
  collect 18969 optional              -- Pristine Yeti Hide
  accept 7735 optional

step Rockbiter
  tip Ride west to the friendly mountain giant at the foot of the hills. Land Walkers and Cliff Giants around him are elite: give them room.
  accept 2844 lvl 44

step Shay Leafrunner
  tip Shay wanders the hills north of Rockbiter, among the Northspring harpies; her bell is in the chest beside her.
  turnin 2844
  accept 2845
  collect 9189 x1 quest 2845          -- Shay's Bell

step Shay's escort
  tip Ring the bell whenever Shay stops to wander, and lead her south to Rockbiter.
  complete 2845 @42.33,21.85          -- Rockbiter's camp
  turnin 2845                         -- Rockbiter

step Feathermoon Stronghold
  tip Hearth to Feathermoon.
  hearth "Feathermoon Stronghold"
  turnin 4265                         -- Ginro Hearthkindle
  accept 4266
  turnin 4266                         -- Shandris Feathermoon
  note Shandris then asks you to carry news to Darnassus: skip it, Gadgetzan sends you there instead.
  turnin 7733                         -- Pratt McGrubben
  turnin 7735 optional

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Level 45

step Zul'Farrak instead of grinding
  zone Tanaris
  tip Running Zul'Farrak instead of grinding gets you there faster in a group. The troll city lies in northern Tanaris, the next zone on the route; come back to Zorbin on the Forgotten Coast afterwards.
  goto 38.7,20.0 "Zul'Farrak" optional

step Grind to 45
  zone Feralas
  tip Boat to the Forgotten Coast and ride east into Feral Scar Vale. Zorbin's quests on the coast need level 45.
  level 45 -- grind on Feral Scar Yeti at Feral Scar Vale, Feralas

step Zorbin Fandazzle
  tip Ride back to the Forgotten Coast; the goblin stands by the dock.
  accept 7003
  accept 7721

step Giants and elementals
  tip Shore Striders, Deep Striders and Wave Striders (elite giants) wade along the coast north of the dock: zap one with Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker and kill the shrunken giant. Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays drift in the same surf.
  collect 18956 quest 7003            -- Miniaturization Residue
  collect 18958 quest 7721            -- Water Elemental Core

step Zorbin Fandazzle
  turnin 7003
  turnin 7721
  note Zorbin's refills are level 55: skip them.
  note You end at the Forgotten Coast dock: the Tanaris guide starts with the trip east from here.
